        {
          "path": "_m/g/c/h/r/abercastle-wp/abercastle-at-low-tide-geograp.jpg",
          "filename": "Abercastle at low tide - geograph.org.uk - 932546.jpg",
          "caption": "Abercastle at low tide Potting boat high and dry in the harbour at Abercastle, with the tide on the way in. Local fishermen are somewhat restricted by the tides in this inlet, but the crabs they catch in their pots are delicious freshly cooked in the pub at nearby Mathry ! Local residents the oystercatcher and herring gull can also be seen looking for food !",
          "alt": "Abercastle at low tide Potting boat high and dry in the harbour at Abercastle, with the tide on the way in. Local fishermen are somewhat restricted by the tides in this inlet, but the crabs they catch in their pots are delicious freshly cooked in the pub at nearby Mathry ! Local residents the oystercatcher and herring gull can also be seen looking for food !",
